	(text "Only this gate runs from VREF, so SYNC <= VREF + 0.3 V in every\nstate; 10k holds SYNC low when VREF is off (IOFF output).\nVREF budget <= 0.6 mA of 5 mA. B-sync-clock.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
